msgstr ""#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/heuristics.md:1
msgid "triton.heuristics"
msgstr "triton.heuristics"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/heuristics.md:7
msgid "用于指定如何计算某些元参数值的装饰器。这在自动调优成本过高或不适用的情况下非常有用。"
msgstr ""
"A decorator for specifying how to compute certain meta-parameter values. "
"This is useful when autotuning is too expensive or not applicable."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/heuristics.md:16
msgid ""
"**参数：** `values (dict[str, Callable[[list[Any]], Any]]**)` - "
"包含元参数名称和计算元参数值的函数的字典。每个这样的函数都接受一个位置参数列表作为输入。"
msgstr ""
"**Parameters:** `values (dict[str, Callable[[list[Any]], Any]])` - A "
"dictionary containing meta-parameter names and functions to compute their "
"values. Each function accepts a list of positional arguments as input."
